window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch173","pages":[{"n":1223,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1013\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第173 章i2c_client 结构体转换流程<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c client 部分会被转换成i2c_client 结构体。本章分析i2c client 转换成i2c_client 结构体的转换流程。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1014\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">173.1 i2c_client 结构体介绍<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c_client 结构体用于表示挂载在i2c 总线下的i2c 外设信息，如寄存器物理地址、设备信息、设备名字等信息，该结构体定义在include/linux/i2c.h 文件中，具体内容如代码清单173.1所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.1<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"13\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">struct i2c_client {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned short flags;        /* 标志位, 用于各种配置和标识*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned short addr;        /* 芯片地址- 注意: 地址是7 位的，存储在低7 位中*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    char name[i2c_NAME_SIZE];  /* 设备名称*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_adapter *adapter;  /* 所在的i2c 控制器*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device dev;       /* 设备结构体*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int init_irq;        /* 初始化时设置的中断号*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int irq;        /* 设备产生的中断号*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct list_head detected;/* 检测到的设备列表*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_i2c_SLAVE)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    i2c_slave_cb_t slave_cb; /* 从模式下的回调函数*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #endif<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1223 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1223\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在编写i2c client 代码时提到了两种方法，第一种是使用设备树通过设备节点编写i2c clie nt 代码，第二种方法是使用C 文件编写i2c client 代码，但是在C 文件中并没有创建的i2c_cli ent 结构体，而是创建i2c_board_info 结构体，实际上i2c_board_info 结构体在调用i2c_new_d evice()函数时候会被转换成i2c_client 结构体并添加所属的i2c 控制器等信息。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1015\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">173.2 使用C 文件实现i2c client 时的转换过程<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">分析使用C 文件创建i2c client 流程需要从平台文件入手，平台文件是描述硬件资源的文件，由于iTOP-RK3568 开发板的内核源码已经使用设备树代替了平台文件，所以本节使用iTOP-4412 开发板3.0 版本的内核源码分析使用C 文件创建i2c client 时的转换过程，该源码存放在网盘iTOP-RK3568 开发板\\07_学习教程配套资料\\03_Linux 驱动配套资料\\04_Linux 驱动程序\\10<\/p>"},{"n":1224,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">7_i2c_client 路径下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">首先找到itop-4412 开发板的平台文件，具体路径为arch/arm/mach-exynos/mach-itop4412.c，在该平台文件中使用了i2c_register_board_info()函数注册i2c_board_info 结构体，具体内容如代码清单173.2 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.2<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"36\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c0_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(0, i2c_devs0, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs0));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c1_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(1, i2c_devs1, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs1));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c2_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(2, i2c_devs2, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs2));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">init_lcd_type();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">get_lcd_type();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">setup_ft5x_width_height();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c3_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(3, i2c_devs3, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs3));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c4_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(4, i2c_devs4, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs4));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#ifdef CONFIG_MPU_SENSORS_MPU6050B1<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">sensor_hw_init();<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#endif<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c5_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(5, i2c_devs5, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs5));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">//For S5K4EC (using i2c6)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">//#ifndef CONFIG_CAN_MCP251X<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#if !defined(CONFIG_CAN_MCP251X) &amp;&amp; !defined(CONFIG_SPI_RC522)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c6_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(6, i2c_devs6, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs6));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#endif<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">s3c_i2c7_set_platdata(NULL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(7, i2c_devs7, ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_devs7));<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1224 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1224\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1225,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c_register_board_info()函数定义在drivers/i2c/i2c-boardinfo.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单173.3 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.3<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"39\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">/*<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 注册i2c 设备到内核的i2c 子系统中<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     *<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @busnum: i2c 总线号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @info: i2c 设备信息数组<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * @len: 设备信息数组的长度<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     *<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 返回值:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">     * 成功时返回0，失败时返回负值错误码<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">*/<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int __init<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_register_board_info(int busnum,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_board_info const *info, unsigned len)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int status;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //获取写锁以保护全局i2c 设备列表<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    down_write(&amp;__i2c_board_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果总线号大于等于第一个动态分配的总线号，更新第一个动态分配的总线号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (busnum &gt;= __i2c_first_dynamic_bus_num)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        __i2c_first_dynamic_bus_num = busnum + 1;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //遍历设备信息数组<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    for (status = 0; len; len--, info++) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //为每个设备分配i2c_devinfo 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        struct i2c_devinfo  *devinfo;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        devinfo = kzalloc(sizeof(*devinfo), GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (!devinfo) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //内存分配失败，打印调试信息并退出<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            pr_debug(&quot;i2c-core: can&#x27;t register boardinfo!\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            status = -ENOMEM;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            break;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //填充i2c_devinfo 结构体的成员，包括总线号和设备信息，将新分配的i2c_devinfo 添加到全局i2c<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">设备列表的末尾<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        devinfo-&gt;busnum = busnum;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        devinfo-&gt;board_info = *info;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1225 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1225\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1226,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"46\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        list_add_tail(&amp;devinfo-&gt;list, &amp;__i2c_board_list);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //释放写锁<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    up_write(&amp;__i2c_board_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}    return status;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1226 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1226\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c_register_board_info()函数有三个参数,其中函数参数busnum 表示i2c 的总线编号，例如i2c0、i2c1 中的0 和1 就属于总线编号，第二个函数参数info 表示i2c_board_info 结构体数组，第三个函数参数len 表示i2c_board_info 结构体数组的长度。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数核心操作是代码清单178.3 中的第25 到41 行代码，第25 到41 行代码给i2c_devi nfo 结构体分配了内容并设置该结构体中的busnum 和board_info 信息，然后将i2c_devinfo 添加到全局i2c 设备列表的末尾。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着打开iTOP-4412 开发板内核源码中的drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-s3c2410.c 文件，在该文件中的probe()函数中按照调用i2c_add_numbered_adapter()-&gt; i2c_register_adapter() -&gt;i2c_scan_st atic_board_info()函数调用关系调用i2c_scan_static_board_info()函数。i2c_scan_static_board_inf o()函数如代码清单178.6 所示，该函数遍历__i2c_board_list 链表并调用第13 行的i2c_new_de vice()函数创建一个新的i2c client。i2c_new_device()函数需要struct i2c_adapter *adap,和stru ct i2c_board_info const *info 俩个函数参数，struct i2c_board_info const *info 函数参数通过&amp;devinfo-&gt;board_info 确定，即在i2c_register_board_info()函数中赋值的i2c_board_info，struct i 2c_adapter *adap 函数参数通过代码devinfo-&gt;busnum==adapter-&gt;nr 确定当前设备是挂载在了哪个i2c 控制器下。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.4<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static void i2c_scan_static_board_info(struct i2c_adapter *adapter)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //定义一个i2c_devinfo 结构体指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_devinfo *devinfo;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //获取__i2c_board_lock 读锁<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    down_read(&amp;__i2c_board_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //遍历__i2c_board_list 链表<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    list_for_each_entry(devinfo, &amp;__i2c_board_list, list) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //检查当前设备是否在当前适配器上<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (devinfo-&gt;busnum == adapter-&gt;nr<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1226 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1226\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1227,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"23\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                &amp;&amp; !i2c_new_device(adapter,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                        &amp;devinfo-&gt;board_info))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //如果添加设备失败,打印错误信息<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            dev_err(&amp;adapter-&gt;dev,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                &quot;Can&#x27;t create device at 0x%02x\\n&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                devinfo-&gt;board_info.addr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //释放__i2c_board_lock 读锁<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    up_read(&amp;__i2c_board_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1227 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1227\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c-s3c2410.c 文件中的probe()函数按照i2c_add_numbered_adapter()-&gt; i2c_register_adapter() -&gt;i2c_scan_static_board_info()函数调用关系创建i2c client 而不是直接调用i2c_new_device()函数创建的原因是需要保证先让i2c 控制器工作起来再添加具体的i2c 外设信息这个顺序。因此关键代码为devinfo-&gt;busnum==adapter-&gt;nr。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1016\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">173.3 使用设备树实现i2c client 时的转换过程<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">ft5x06 触摸芯片设备节点如代码清单173.5 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.5<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"20\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c1: i2c@fe5a0000 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    compatible = &quot;rockchip,rk3399-i2c&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    reg = &lt;0x0 0xfe5a0000 0x0 0x1000&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    clocks = &lt;&amp;cru CLK_i2c1&gt;, &lt;&amp;cru PCLK_i2c1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    clock-names = &quot;i2c&quot;, &quot;pclk&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    interrupts = &lt;GIC_SPI 47 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    pinctrl-names = &quot;default&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    pinctrl-0 = &lt;&amp;i2c1_xfer&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #address-cells = &lt;1&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    #size-cells = &lt;0&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = &quot;disabled&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    myft5x06: my-ft5x06@38 {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;my-ft5x06&quot;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        reg = &lt;0x38&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        reset-gpios = &lt;&amp;gpio0 RK_PB6 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        interrupt-parent = &lt;&amp;gpio3&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        interrupts-gpio = &lt;&amp;gpio3 RK_PA5 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        interrupts = &lt;RK_PA5 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        pinctrl-names = &quot;default&quot;;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1227 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1227\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1228,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"23\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        pinctrl-0 = &lt;&amp;myft5x06_pins&gt;;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    };<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">};<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1228 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1228\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">根据设备树篇讲解的相关知识，i2c1 控制器节点会转换成为platform_device，但由于在该节点中并没有特殊的属性值，所以它的子节点myft5x06 并不会被转换成platform_device。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">这里老师直接讲结论，子节点myft5x06 会被转换成i2c client 结构体，接下来我们分析转化流程。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">打开内核源码drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-rk3x.c 路径中i2c 控制器驱动，在i2c 控制器驱动中的probe()函数中会调用i2c_add_adapter()函数注册i2c 控制器，具体内容如代码清单173.6 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.6<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"7\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rk3x_i2c_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ......<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //注册i2c 控制器<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = i2c_add_adapter(&amp;i2c-&gt;adap);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ......<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1228 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1228\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c_add_adapter()用于注册i2c 控制器，该函数定义在drivers/i2c/i2c-core-base.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单173.7 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.7<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"20\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">//添加i2c 控制器的函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int i2c_add_adapter(struct i2c_adapter *adapter)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //获取适配器的设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device *dev = &amp;adapter-&gt;dev;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //声明一个ID 变量<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int id;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果设备节点存在<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (dev-&gt;of_node) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //从设备树别名中获取i2c 总线号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        id = of_alias_get_id(dev-&gt;of_node, &quot;i2c&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果总线号有效<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (id &gt;= 0) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //设置适配器编号为获取的总线号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            adapter-&gt;nr = id;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //添加编号的i2c 控制器<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return __i2c_add_numbered_adapter(adapter);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1228 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1228\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1229,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"21\" data-end=\"39\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //加锁，防止并发访问<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    mutex_lock(&amp;core_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //在i2c_adapter_idr 动态ID 池中分配一个ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    id = idr_alloc(&amp;i2c_adapter_idr, adapter,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                   __i2c_first_dynamic_bus_num, 0, GFP_KERNEL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //解锁<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    mutex_unlock(&amp;core_lock);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果分配ID 失败<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (WARN(id &lt; 0, &quot;couldn&#x27;t get idr&quot;))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //返回错误码<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return id;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //设置适配器编号为分配的ID<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    adapter-&gt;nr = id;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //注册i2c 控制器<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return i2c_register_adapter(adapter);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1229 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1229\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">代码清单173.9 中第10-20 行首先尝试从设备树别名中获取i2c 总线号，i2c 总线号就是i2c0、i2c1 的0 和1 。如果获取总线号成功，则直接使用这个总线号并使用__i2c_add_numbered_adapter()函数注册i2c 控制器。如果获取总线号失败则通过第25-26 行代码从动态ID 池中分配一个ID 作为i2c 控制器编号。然后通过第38 行代码调用i2c_register_adapter() 函数注册i2c 控制器，在i2c_register_adapter() 函数中本质是通过of_i2c_register_devices()函数注册i2c 控制器。如代码清单173.8 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.8<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"7\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">// i2c 控制器注册函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int i2c_register_adapter(struct i2c_adapter *adap)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ......<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_i2c_register_devices(adap);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ......<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1229 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1229\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">of_i2c_register_devices()函数具体内容如代码清单173.9 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.9<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"3\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">void of_i2c_register_devices(struct i2c_adapter *adap)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //声明两个设备树节点指针变量，分别用于表示i2c 总线节点和i2c 从设备节点<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1229 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1229\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1230,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"42\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device_node *bus, *node;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //声明一个i2c 从设备客户端指针变量<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_client *client;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //只有当i2c 控制器有关联的设备树节点时，才继续注册从设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!adap-&gt;dev.of_node)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //打印调试信息，表示正在遍历i2c 从设备节点<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_dbg(&amp;adap-&gt;dev, &quot;of_i2c: walking child nodes\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //尝试从i2c 控制器的设备树节点中获取名为&quot;i2c-bus&quot;的子节点<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果没有找到该子节点，则直接使用i2c 控制器的设备树节点作为i2c 总线节点<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    bus = of_get_child_by_name(adap-&gt;dev.of_node, &quot;i2c-bus&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!bus)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        bus = of_node_get(adap-&gt;dev.of_node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //遍历i2c 总线节点的所有可用子节点<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    for_each_available_child_of_node(bus, node) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //检查该i2c 从设备节点是否已被标记为已注册<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果已被标记，则跳过该节点，避免重复注册<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (of_node_test_and_set_flag(node, OF_POPULATED))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            continue;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //使用of_i2c_register_device 函数注册i2c 从设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //该函数根据设备树节点的属性创建并注册i2c_client 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        client = of_i2c_register_device(adap, node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (IS_ERR(client)) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //如果注册失败，打印错误消息，并清除节点的&quot;已注册&quot;标志，以便下次可以重新尝试注册<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            dev_err(&amp;adap-&gt;dev,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                &quot;Failed to create i2c device for %pOF\\n&quot;,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            of_node_clear_flag(node, OF_POPULATED);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //释放对i2c 总线节点的引用<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    of_node_put(bus);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1230 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1230\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">of_i2c_register_devices() 函数核心代码是代码清单173.12 中第30 行的of_i2c_register_device()函数，该函数如代码清单173.10 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.10<\/p>"},{"n":1231,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"27\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static struct i2c_client *of_i2c_register_device(struct i2c_adapter *adap,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                          struct device_node *node)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //声明i2c_client 和i2c_board_info 结构体指针变量<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_client *client;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_board_info info;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //打印调试信息,表示正在注册设备树节点<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_dbg(&amp;adap-&gt;dev, &quot;of_i2c: register %pOF\\n&quot;, node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //根据设备树节点信息填充i2c_board_info 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = of_i2c_get_board_info(&amp;adap-&gt;dev, node, &amp;info);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果获取i2c_board_info 信息失败，返回错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(ret);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //使用i2c_new_device()函数注册i2c_client 设备<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    client = i2c_new_device(adap, &amp;info);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!client) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果注册失败，打印错误信息并返回错误指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;adap-&gt;dev, &quot;of_i2c: Failure registering %pOF\\n&quot;, node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(-EINVAL);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //返回成功注册的i2c_client 指针<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return client;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1231 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1231\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">of_i2c_register_device()函数中调用of_i2c_get_board_info()函数解析i2c 外设节点构建i2c_board_info 结构体，of_i2c_get_board_info()函数的具体内容如代码清单173.11 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.11<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">int of_i2c_get_board_info(struct device *dev, struct device_node *node,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">              struct i2c_board_info *info)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //声明地址和返回值变量<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    u32 addr;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //清空i2c_board_info 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    memset(info, 0, sizeof(*info));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //从设备树节点获取modalias 字符串<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (of_modalias_node(node, info-&gt;type, sizeof(info-&gt;type)) &lt; 0) {<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1231 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1231\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1232,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"13\" data-end=\"56\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果获取modalias 失败，打印错误信息并返回<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(dev, &quot;of_i2c: modalias failure on %pOF\\n&quot;, node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -EINVAL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //从设备树节点获取reg 属性(设备地址)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    ret = of_property_read_u32(node, &quot;reg&quot;, &amp;addr);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (ret) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果获取地址失败，打印错误信息并返回<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(dev, &quot;of_i2c: invalid reg on %pOF\\n&quot;, node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ret;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //检查地址是否为10 位地址模式<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (addr &amp; i2c_TEN_BIT_ADDRESS) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //清除高位标志，并设置i2c_board_info 的flags<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        addr &amp;= ~i2c_TEN_BIT_ADDRESS;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;flags |= i2c_CLIENT_TEN;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //检查地址是否为从设备地址模式<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (addr &amp; i2c_OWN_SLAVE_ADDRESS) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //清除高位标志，并设置i2c_board_info 的flags<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        addr &amp;= ~i2c_OWN_SLAVE_ADDRESS;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;flags |= i2c_CLIENT_SLAVE;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //填充i2c_board_info 结构体的addr、of_node 和fwnode 字段<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;addr = addr;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;of_node = node;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    info-&gt;fwnode = of_fwnode_handle(node);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //检查设备树节点是否有&quot;host-notify&quot;属性<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (of_property_read_bool(node, &quot;host-notify&quot;))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果有,设置i2c_board_info 的flags<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;flags |= i2c_CLIENT_HOST_NOTIFY;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //检查设备树节点是否有&quot;wakeup-source&quot;属性<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (of_get_property(node, &quot;wakeup-source&quot;, NULL))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果有，设置i2c_board_info 的flags<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        info-&gt;flags |= i2c_CLIENT_WAKE;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //返回0，表示成功获取并填充i2c_board_info 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1232 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1232\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1233,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"57\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1233 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1233\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">i2c_board_info 结构体构建完成后调用i2c_new_device()函数创建i2c client。所以使用设备树编写的i2c client 会先被转换成i2c_board_info 结构体，然后由i2c_board_info 结构体在转换成i2c_client 结构体。<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">但还有一个地方需要注意，在解析i2c 外设节点构建i2c_board_info 结构体时并没有解析设备树中的中断内容，而在编写ft5x06 的驱动时确用到了i2c_client 结构体中的中断信息，如代码清单178.11 中断相关代码，i2c_client 结构体中的中断号是在哪里进行的赋值呢？<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.12<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"2\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        ret = request_irq(client-&gt;irq, ft5x06_handler,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                     IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_FALLING | IRQF_ONESHOT, &quot;ft5x06 irq&quot;, NULL);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1233 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1233\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在执行ft5x06 驱动的probe()函数之前，会先执行drivers/i2c/i2c-core-base.c 文件中的i2c_device_probe()函数，该函数的具体内容如代码清单173.13 所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单173.13<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"26\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">static int i2c_device_probe(struct device *dev)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">{<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //从device 结构体中获取i2c_client 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_client    *client = i2c_verify_client(dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //从device 结构体中获取i2c_driver 结构体<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_driver    *driver;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    int status;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果client 不存在，则返回0<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!client)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //将dev-&gt;driver 转换为i2c_driver 类型<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    driver = to_i2c_driver(dev-&gt;driver);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果client 没有中断号且driver 没有禁用i2c 核心中断映射，则尝试获取中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!client-&gt;irq &amp;&amp; !driver-&gt;disable_i2c_core_irq_mapping) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int irq = -ENOENT;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果client 使用Host Notify 中断，则使用i2c_smbus_host_notify_to_irq 获取中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (client-&gt;flags &amp; i2c_CLIENT_HOST_NOTIFY) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            dev_dbg(dev, &quot;Using Host Notify IRQ\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            //保持适配器处于活动状态，因为需要Host Notify 中断<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            pm_runtime_get_sync(&amp;client-&gt;adapter-&gt;dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            irq = i2c_smbus_host_notify_to_irq(client);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1233 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1233\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1234,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"70\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果设备有DT 节点，则尝试从DT 节点获取中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else if (dev-&gt;of_node) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            irq = of_irq_get_byname(dev-&gt;of_node, &quot;irq&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (irq == -EINVAL || irq == -ENODATA)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                irq = of_irq_get(dev-&gt;of_node, 0);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果设备有ACPI 关联，则尝试从ACPI 获取中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else if (ACPI_COMPANION(dev)) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            irq = acpi_dev_gpio_irq_get(ACPI_COMPANION(dev), 0);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果获取中断号失败，则设置为0<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (irq == -Eprobe_DEFER)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            return irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (irq &lt; 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            irq = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //将获取到的中断号设置到client 结构体中<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        client-&gt;irq = irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果driver 没有ID 表，且设备也没有匹配的OF 或ACPI ID 表，则返回-ENODEV<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!driver-&gt;id_table &amp;&amp;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        !i2c_acpi_match_device(dev-&gt;driver-&gt;acpi_match_table, client) &amp;&amp;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">51<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        !i2c_of_match_device(dev-&gt;driver-&gt;of_match_table, client))<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENODEV;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果client 需要唤醒功能，则尝试设置唤醒中断<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (client-&gt;flags &amp; i2c_CLIENT_WAKE) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        int wakeirq = -ENOENT;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果设备有DT 节点，则尝试从DT 节点获取唤醒中断号<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (dev-&gt;of_node) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            wakeirq = of_irq_get_byname(dev-&gt;of_node, &quot;wakeup&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            if (wakeirq == -Eprobe_DEFER)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                return wakeirq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //启用设备的唤醒功能<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        device_init_wakeup(&amp;client-&gt;dev, true);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">68<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果获取到了唤醒中断号，且与普通中断号不同，则设置专用唤醒中断<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">69<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (wakeirq &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; wakeirq != client-&gt;irq)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">70<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            status = dev_pm_set_dedicated_wake_irq(dev, wakeirq);<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1234 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1234\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1235,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"114\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">71<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //否则，使用普通中断作为唤醒中断<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">72<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else if (client-&gt;irq &gt; 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">73<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            status = dev_pm_set_wake_irq(dev, client-&gt;irq);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">74<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        else<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">75<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            status = 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">76<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">77<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        //如果设置唤醒中断失败，则输出警告<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">78<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (status)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">79<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">            dev_warn(&amp;client-&gt;dev, &quot;failed to set up wakeup irq\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">80<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">81<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_dbg(dev, &quot;probe\\n&quot;);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">83<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">84<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //设置设备的时钟默认值<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">85<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = of_clk_set_defaults(dev-&gt;of_node, false);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">86<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (status &lt; 0)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">87<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto err_clear_wakeup_irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">88<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">89<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //附加PM 域<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">90<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = dev_pm_domain_attach(&amp;client-&gt;dev, true);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">91<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (status)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">92<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto err_clear_wakeup_irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">93<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">94<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //调用driver 的probe_new 或probe 函数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">95<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (driver-&gt;probe_new)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">96<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        status = driver-&gt;probe_new(client);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">97<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    else if (driver-&gt;probe)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">98<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        status = driver-&gt;probe(client,<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">99<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">                              i2c_match_id(driver-&gt;id_table, client));<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">100<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    else<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">101<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        status = -EINVAL;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">102<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">103<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    //如果probe 函数失败，则清除唤醒中断并分离PM 域<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">104<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (status) {<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">105<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_pm_domain_detach(&amp;client-&gt;dev, true);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">106<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto err_clear_wakeup_irq;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">107<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    }<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">108<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">109<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">110<\/span><span class=\"source-line\"><\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">111<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">err_clear_wakeup_irq:<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">112<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_pm_clear_wake_irq(&amp;client-&gt;dev);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">113<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    device_init_wakeup(&amp;client-&gt;dev, false);<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">114<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">    return status;<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1235 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1235\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>"},{"n":1236,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"115\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">115<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">}<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1236 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1236\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中代码清单173.13 第28 行-第36 行代码会解析设备树中的中断信息从而获取irq，在第45 行将获取到的中断号设置到client 结构体中。所以在ft5x06 的驱动中可以通过client-&gt;irq 使用中断号。<\/p>"},{"n":1237,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1017\"><\/span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第174 章应用程序中使用i2c 总线通信步骤讲解<\/h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章学习在应用程序中如何使用i2c 进行通信。<\/p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1018\"><\/span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">174.1 ioctl 命令讲解<\/h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在应用程序中可以通过ioctl 函数控制i2c 控制器从而对i2c 设备进行操作。ioctl 函数介绍如下所示：函数原型：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">int ioctl(int fd, unsigned int cmd, unsigned long args);头文件：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">#include &lt;sys/ioctl.h&gt;函数作用：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">用于向设备发送控制和配置命令。参数含义：<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">fd：是用户程序打开设备时返回的文件描述符<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">cmd：是用户程序对设备的控制命令<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">args：应用程序向驱动程序下发的参数，如果传递的参数为指针类型，则可以接收驱动向用户空间传递的数据<\/p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">我们重点看在操作i2c 控制器时ioctl 函数的函数参数cmd 都有哪些控制命令。i2c 控制器的控制命令cmd 定义在include/uapi/linux/i2c-dev.h 文件中，具体内容如代码清单所示。<\/p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单174.1<\/p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"9\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单<\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码<\/button><\/div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_RETRIES     0x0701  //设置重试次数,即当从设备没有响应时要重新轮询的次数<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_TIMEOUT     0x0702  //设置超时时间，单位为10 毫秒<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_SLAVE       0x0703  //使用此从机地址<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_SLAVE_FORCE 0x0706  //强制使用此从机地址<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_TENBIT      0x0704  //0 表示7 位地址，非0 表示10 位地址<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_FUNCS       0x0705 //获取适配器功能掩码<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_RDWR        0x0707  //执行合并读写传输(只有一个STOP 信号)<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_PEC        0x0708 //使用PEC(校验码)进行SMBus 传输<\/span><\/span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9<\/span><span class=\"source-line\">#define i2c_SMBUS       0x0720  //执行SMBus 传输<\/span><\/span><\/code><\/pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1237 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1237\">核对原页<\/button><\/p><\/div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Linux 提供了9 个ioctl 控制命令，在本章的读写实验中通过命令i2c_RDWR 进行数据传输。在使用i2c_RDWR 命令时，需要向ioctl 函数的第三个函数参数传递一个i2c_rdwr_ioctl_data 类<\/p>"}]});
